 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COMIC THAT IS BEING ERASED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You wake up inside a comic. Paper underfoot, ink lines, halftone dots in the sky. And the page is</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  shrinking. An eraser chews inward from the edge, day after day, and whatever it reaches is simply gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  No weapon, no tools, no camp. You have a sketchbook. That is the whole plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/c6df339b789fe832abeeee9a21e23fbf.mp4?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU DRAW WHAT YOU NEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  There is no crafting menu. You open your sketchbook, and on the page are grey guide lines in the shape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  of an axe. You trace them by hand. And then you are holding an axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Nothing snaps your line onto the guide. That part is you, and the page can tell how well you did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INK IS EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  One resource, and it is inside all of it. Every stroke drinks it. Every glyph. Every obelisk costs a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  lot. Enemies splash ink when you land a hit. At night it rains ink, which tops you up and chills you at</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/60d64bbfbaa836d412bd78860e708fbb.mp4?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSH THE ERASER BACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Nine obelisks stand on the page. Walk up, hold the key, pay the ink, and the eraser gives up thirty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  metres. That is the only language it understands. Let a day pass without re-inking one and it comes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/74185754b645b40c3d68876bdf5d5207.poster.avif?t=1788935185\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/74185754b645b40c3d68876bdf5d5207.webm?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187050/extras/74185754b645b40c3d68876bdf5d5207.mp4?t=1788935185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE NIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Hunger, thirst and warmth drain the whole time. Your tools crack, then break. The Unfinished come out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  after dark, and nobody coloured them in. Build a shelter that holds, or draw yourself a bed and sleep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  through it.</p>",
